    {
      "timestamp": "2026-11-10T11:29:58+00:00",
      "action": "triage_confirm_observe",
      "issue_ids": [],
      "cluster_name": null,
      "actor": "user",
      "note": null,
      "detail": {
        "attestation": "I reviewed the observe stage and independently reproduced its two highest-impact verdicts against the running code before confirming. For logic_clarity, txBatteryStatus=255 publishes 1,2,4..128 while batteryStatusISS and the batteryStatusChannel base entry both declare payload_on: 1, so 7 of 8 battery sensors can never report low -- the stage's correction of the reviewer's 'channels 2-7' to 'channels 1-7' is right. For contract_coherence, the early return at controller.py:109 leaves mqtt_client and availability_topic unset and shutDown dereferences both at :480. I also accept its resolution of the type_safety unit_system contradiction (delete the dead guards) and its rejection of the api_surface_coherence get_key_config returns-None claim, both of which match checks I ran myself. Dimensions covered include logic_clarity, contract_coherence, type_safety, api_surface_coherence, test_strategy, initialization_coupling and cross_module_architecture."
      }
    },
