      "note": "Deferred to the follow-up PR. Moving loop_start() out of init_mqtt_client (controller.py:198) so the publishers exist before the network thread fixes none of the four reproduced defects, changes MQTT start-up ordering in the one function that already needed an incident fix for felddy/weewx-home-assistant#74, and invalidates tests/test_mqtt_startup.py:55-60. The whole payoff is deleting two getattr probes at :216 and :244. The fix is more intricate than the thing it fixes, so it belongs in a PR where that ordering change is the headline.",
      "detail": {
        "kind": "permanent",
        "reason": null
      }
