      "cluster_name": null,
      "actor": "user",
      "note": "The stated defect is REJECTED on evidence: get_key_config has a three-step fallback (exact match at utils.py:147, numeric-suffix base key at :157, generated guess at :190) and returns a dict on every exit, verified by calling it -- get_key_config('definitelyNotASensorKey') yields {'metadata': {'name': 'Definitely Not A Sensor Key'}} -- so the predicted TypeError in dict(get_key_config(key)) cannot occur. Its surviving half, that utils.py:150-190 has zero coverage, is real but unrelated to the four defects and is deferred with the other coverage work.",
      "detail": {
        "kind": "permanent",
        "reason": null
      }
